OL,3,AHarry Styles, Billie Eilish, Sam Fender
OL,4,Aand Cher to headline Glastonbury 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther acts on the line-up include
OL,7,FSombr, Sienna Spiro, Lily Allen, The
OL,8,FStreets, Chase & Status, Kacey
OL,9,FMusgraves, Primal Scream and breakout
OL,10,Fpop star Adela.
OL,12,FTickets for the festival sold out in
OL,13,Fjust 42 minutes last month, with demand
OL,14,Fparticularly high after the event took
OL,15,Fa year off in 2026.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
